//! Normative tables of the DTS Coherent Acoustics core decoder, transcribed
//! from ETSI TS 102 114 V1.6.1 (2019-08), Annex D (normative): Large Tables.
//!
//! GENERATED by `tools/dts_gen_tables.py` from the `pdftotext
//! -layout` rendering of the ETSI PDF — do not edit by hand. The generator
//! checks every Huffman book for completeness (Kraft sum 1), prefix-freeness
//! and level coverage, and cross-checks the books and FIRs against the
//! independent V1.2.1 (2002-12) rendering. Page numbers are those of V1.6.1.
//!
//! Two defects of the V1.6.1 PDF are resolved from V1.2.1 (whose tables pass
//! the checks): `D65` is printed without its ±31/±32 rows, and `D129` prints
//! level 37 twice where the second is −37.
//!
//! Not transcribed, because no ETSI edition prints them ("Due to its extensive
//! size, this table is not included here", D.10): the ADPCM prediction
//! coefficient VQ codebook (D.10.1) and the high-frequency subband VQ
//! codebook (D.10.2). See `super::Decoder` for how their absence is handled.

